ture combinations beyond default/`--no-default-features` (`Cargo.toml` declares no `[features]`) — so I ran both profiles instead, since debug enables overflow checks and the C relies on unsigned wraparound.\n\n`c_src/` untouched; `libloading = \"0.8\"` added to `[dev-dependencies]`. Note the sandbox has no crates.io access, so everything runs `--offline` against the cached `libloading 0.8.9`.","ttft_ms":3754,"type":"result","duration_ms":619925,"uuid":"fad04e72-6cad-4b92-b257-b671bc0bc205","ttft_stream_ms":3583,"time_to_request_ms":50,"first_content_frame_ms":3583,"queued_turn_count":0}
